# TermMax Strategy Vault API
# - Leave unset in local dev: Vite proxies /termmax-api → Render (avoids browser CORS).
# - Set to full URL only if the API sends Access-Control-Allow-Origin for your frontend origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://termmax-strategy-vault-service.onrender.com

# Optional: custom RPC endpoints (recommended for production / heavy use)
# VITE_RPC_URL_MAINNET=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
# VITE_RPC_URL_SEPOLIA=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
